---
/* SPEC §3: four operating facts, nothing adjectival, nothing invented. */
const facts = [
  {
    title: "We work your hours",
    body:
      "We work 9am to 5pm EST, Monday to Friday. On the US East Coast that is your whole working day. In the UK, Europe or Australia we agree a regular call time inside those hours before work starts.",
    tag: "Hours",
  },
  {
    title: "A written reply inside one working day",
    body:
      "Messages sent between 9am and 5pm EST are answered the same day. Anything sent later is answered by the end of our next working day, and you always know which of us picked it up.",
    tag: "Response time",
  },
  {
    title: "You own the code at every milestone",
    body:
      "Each milestone is yours the moment it is paid for: the repository, its full history and the deployment configuration. Nothing is held back until the final invoice clears.",
    tag: "Ownership",
  },
  {
    title: "We sign your NDA first",
    body:
      "Send your NDA and we sign it before the first call. If you do not have one, we send ours. Your idea and your codebase stay confidential from the first message.",
    tag: "Confidentiality",
  },
];
---

<section class="v4-section v4-section--rule" aria-labelledby="v4-hold-title">
  <div class="v4-container v4-split">
    <div class="v4-split__head">
      <p class="v4-eyebrow" data-v4-reveal>How we work with clients</p>
      <h2 class="v4-h2" id="v4-hold-title" data-v4-reveal data-v4-delay="60">
        Four commitments you can hold us to.
      </h2>
      <p class="v4-body" data-v4-reveal data-v4-delay="120" style="margin-top: var(--v4-4)">
        Working with a remote development team should feel as dependable as
        working with one down the hall. These are the terms that make it so,
        and if any of them stops being true, it comes off this page.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="v4-deal" data-v4-group data-v4-step="90">
      {
        facts.map((fact) => (
          <li class="v4-card v4-card--lift v4-deal__card" data-v4-group-item>
            <p class="v4-small v4-deal__tag">{fact.tag}</p>
            <h3 class="v4-h4 v4-deal__title">{fact.title}</h3>
            <p class="v4-body">{fact.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
